<https://id.i2idl.org/definitions/instructional-systems> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value> "Coordinated arrangements of people, content, processes, resources, and technologies that support instruction and its intended objectives." <https://id.i2idl.org/graphs/concepts/instructional-systems/versions/1> .
